description:
Exploration question: Find every place `parseDuration` is used.

Files read (every line is numbered as `line | code`; this is everything that has been read):

`src/time/parse.ts`
```
1 | export function parseDuration(input: string): number {
2 |   const m = /^(\d+)(ms|s|m)$/.exec(input);
3 |   if (!m) throw new Error(`bad duration: ${input}`);
4 |   const n = Number(m[1]);
5 |   return m[2] === "ms" ? n : m[2] === "s" ? n * 1000 : n * 60000;
6 | }
```

`src/time/index.ts`
```
1 | export { parseDuration as toMillis } from "./parse";
2 | export { sleep } from "./sleep";
```

`src/server/timeouts.ts`
